# Prettier reads .gitignore as well as this file, and .gitignore here denies
# everything and opts back in. So node_modules, .svelte-kit, .wrangler, build
# output and worker-configuration.d.ts are already excluded, and listing them
# again would only be a second copy of a rule that can drift.
#
# What is left is the file the allowlist lets through and Prettier should still
# not touch: the lockfile is written by pnpm, and reformatting it would put this
# repository's whitespace into a file every install rewrites.

pnpm-lock.yaml
